<!DOCTYPE html>
<html>
<head>
  <meta charset="utf-8">
  <style>
    body { font-family: Arial, sans-serif; line-height: 1.6; color: #333; }
    .container { max-width: 600px; margin: 0 auto; padding: 20px; }
    .footer { margin-top: 30px; font-size: 12px; color: #777; border-top: 1px solid #eee; padding-top: 10px; }
    a { color: #0066cc; }
  </style>
</head>
<body>
  <div class="container">
    <p>Hi {{firstName}},</p>

    <p>I wanted to follow up on my earlier note regarding our student initiative.</p>

    {{#if personalization}}
    <p>Given your background in {{personalization}}, we believe your insights would be especially valuable to our student group.</p>
    {{/if}}

    <p>Would you have a few minutes this week or next for a brief chat?</p>

    <p>Best regards,<br>{{senderName}}</p>

    <div class="footer">
      <p>If you'd prefer not to receive further emails, <a href="{{unsubscribeUrl}}">click here to unsubscribe</a>.</p>
    </div>
  </div>
</body>
</html>
